{"results":[{"url":"https://www.foodstandards.gov.au/","final_url":"https://www.foodstandards.gov.au/","title":"Homepage | Food Standards Australia New Zealand","description":null,"language":"en","text":"# Safe food for life\n\nFood safety is our business. FSANZ has set the standards for safe food in Australia and New Zealand for more than 25 years. Our work is at the heart of the world class bi-national food regulation system, ensuring consumers in both countries can be confident the food they buy is safe to eat.\n\n### Add block\n\n## Australian food recalls\n\nSee all recalls\n\n### Pump Spring Water – All Products\n\nCoca-Cola Europacific Partners Australia Pty Ltd\n\n* National\n* Online\n\n---\n\n### Maria’s Pasta – Various Products\n\nMaria’s Pasta\n\n* VIC\n* Online\n\n---\n\n### Bomberry Various Products – 150g\n\nAtomic Changes Pty Ltd t/a Bomberry\n\n* National\n* Online\n\n---\n\n## Resources","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":430.48911399091594,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}